{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香脆可可杏仁撻底+香蕉海鹽焦糖</p><p>享樂烘焙推出全新香蕉拖肥批！</p><p>香蕉拖肥批熱潮不斷，連享樂烘焙都加入戰圈推出全新香蕉海鹽焦糖拖肥批，只限牛頭角及荔枝角門市發售。提供$55件裝及原個$448(只限預訂），以可可杏仁撻底作基底，配合自家煮海鹽焦糖、香蕉與香草馬斯卡彭忌廉，加上LOTUS脆脆口感，每啖都充滿焦糖香氣，柔滑又有層次感。開賣第一天1小時即沽清，想食的朋友仔就要早啲去啦！</p><p>享樂烘焙 官方IG：@ly_bakery</p><p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179221682309591761_6415009526ad30ef762ad7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179221682499825877_2070246726ad30ef981a56.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179221682726480200_936267006ad30efba6c4d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179221682908339876_21297615606ad30efdb7c52.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179221683108158927_12114037706ad30eff66bfd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T06:18:58.286729+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":367,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T06:00:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T12:37:57.812866+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T06:17:35.615362+00:00","content_hash":"3dd93102362427ad632b245dcb4b0ba531f4ad360b6c6c636cafcc5adf1d7477","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}